# Big Data Visualization: A Survey

**Authors:** Luay Thamer Mohammed, Abdallah A. Alhabshy, K. Eldahshan

## Abstract
Due to the rapid development in our world today, multiple data sources from various sources such as sensors, the internet of things, healthcare data, etc., have been increased. So, it is necessary to analyze these data to obtain valuable data and visualize it with visualization tools. Big data visualization plays an essential role in today's world for decision-makers. This paper surveys big data concepts, big data visualization concepts, and big data visualization tools and techniques. Moreover, this paper presents an up-to-date comprehensive comparison among numerous big data visualization tools based on the characteristics and criteria of each visualization tool.

